L34: Long-term effect of astaxanthin supplementation on the oxidative status
L35: None of resting oxidative status measurements in April (before supplementation) differed significantly between groups (Table  3 ). The long-term effect of astaxanthin supplementation on the oxidative status measurements at rest involved significant increase in TAS, and significant decrease in GR and TBARS (Fig.  3 ).
